# Pricing: rate sheets, rates, rate websites, a deal's matching rates, priced drafts, market checks.

@token = PASTE-A-PRICING-OR-ADMIN-DEV-TOKEN
@sheetId = PASTE-A-RATE-SHEET-ID
@dealId = PASTE-A-DEAL-ID
@quoteId = PASTE-A-DRAFT-QUOTE-ID

### Rate sheets (library Rates/ folder and uploads)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pricing/sheets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Upload an Excel or CSV sheet (same file name replaces its rates)
POST {{baseUrl}}/pricing/sheets/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: upload-rates-1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=rates

--rates
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="default_currency"

USD
--rates
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="rates.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

POL,POD,Equipment,Charge,Rate,Currency,Valid till,TT,Line
Chennai,Jebel Ali,40HC,Ocean freight,1450,USD,31/12/2026,14,MSC
,,40HC,BAF,180,USD,,,
--rates--

### A sheet with its row problems and detected columns
GET {{baseUrl}}/pricing/sheets/{{sheetId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Choose the price column of a tab and re-import
PUT {{baseUrl}}/pricing/sheets/{{sheetId}}/mapping
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mapping": { "CSV": { "amount": "Rate" } } }

### Search rates (valid today unless include_expired=true)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pricing/rates?origin=Chennai&destination=AEJEA&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a rate website (https link, no login stored)
POST {{baseUrl}}/pricing/sources
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: source-1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rate portal",
  "website": "https://rates.example",
  "lane_url_template": "https://rates.example/search?from={origin}&to={destination}&eq={equipment}",
  "service_lines": ["ocean"]
}

### A deal's matching rates, website links and market checks
GET {{baseUrl}}/pricing/deals/{{dealId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Let the AI map an unusual lane spelling onto the places in the sheets
POST {{baseUrl}}/pricing/deals/{{dealId}}/match-lane
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Draft a quote from the best option (10 % markup); never sent automatically
POST {{baseUrl}}/pricing/deals/{{dealId}}/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: draft-from-rates-1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "option_index": 0, "markup_percent": 10 }

### Fill an existing draft from the sheets
POST {{baseUrl}}/pricing/quotes/{{quoteId}}/fill
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: fill-1
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Record a rate seen on a website
POST {{baseUrl}}/pricing/deals/{{dealId}}/checks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: check-1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source_name": "Rate portal", "amount": 1400, "currency": "USD", "unit": "container", "equipment": "40HC" }

### Lane history (sheet and market rates)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pricing/lanes/history?origin=INMAA&destination=Jebel%20Ali&equipment=40HC
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
